---
layout: base.njk
---

<div class="container">
  <div class="main-content">
    {%- if metadata.media.featuredImage %}
    <div class="featured-image" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
      <img src="{{ metadata.media.featuredImage }}" alt="{{ title | safe }}" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;">
    </div>
    {%- endif %}

    {# Tell Pagefind which image to use for search results (prefer ogImage) #}
    {%- set pagefindImage = metadata.media.ogImage or metadata.media.infographic or metadata.media.featuredImage %}
    <article{% if pagefindImage %} data-pagefind-meta="image:{{ pagefindImage }}"{% endif %}>
      <h1>{{ title | safe }}</h1>
      <div class="post-meta" style="color: #666; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        <time datetime="{{ date | dateToISO }}">{{ date | readableDate }}</time>
        <span style="margin: 0 8px;">•</span>
        <span>By <a href="/author/mikepsinn/" rel="author" style="color: #000; text-decoration: underline;">{{ site.author.name }}</a></span>
      </div>

      {%- if metadata.categories %}
      <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><strong>Categories:</strong>
        {%- for category in metadata.categories %}
          {{ category }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </p>
      {%- endif %}

      {# Infographic #}
      {%- if metadata.media.infographic %}
      <div class="infographic-section" style="margin: 40px 0; text-align: center;">
        <img src="{{ metadata.media.infographic }}"
             alt="Infographic for {{ title | safe }}"
             style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
      </div>
      {%- endif %}

      <div class="post-content" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        {{ content | safe }}
      </div>

      {# Book CTA — reuses .h2ewd-notice / .h2ewd-read-button from base.njk #}
      <style>
        .book-cta {
          margin: 40px 0 0;
          padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.75rem;
        }
        .book-cta p {
          margin: 0 0 0.75em;
        }
        .book-cta .h2ewd-read-button {
          margin-top: 0.75rem;
        }
      </style>
      <div class="book-cta h2ewd-notice" data-pagefind-ignore>
        <p>Enjoyed the cheerful statistics? There is a whole book of them: <em>How to End War and Disease</em>, a plan to redirect 1% of military spending, $27 billion a year, from ending lives to extending them.</p>
        <p>That buys pragmatic trials that cut drug development costs 82x and save an estimated 416 million lives. So far, approximately zero generals have returned our calls.</p>
        <a href="https://manual.warondisease.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="h2ewd-read-button">Read How to End War and Disease (Free)</a>
      </div>

      {# Social Sharing Buttons #}
      <div class="social-sharing">
        <h3>Share this post</h3>
        <div class="share-buttons">
          {%- set postUrl = site.url + page.url %}
          {%- set postTitle = title | safe %}
          {%- set encodedUrl = postUrl | urlencode %}
          {%- set encodedTitle = postTitle | urlencode %}

          <a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url={{ encodedUrl }}&text={{ encodedTitle }}"
             target="_blank"
             rel="noopener noreferrer"
             class="share-button twitter"
             aria-label="Share on Twitter">
            <span class="icon">🐦</span>
            <span>Twitter</span>
          </a>

          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u={{ encodedUrl }}"
             target="_blank"
             rel="noopener noreferrer"
             class="share-button facebook"
             aria-label="Share on Facebook">
            <span class="icon">📘</span>
            <span>Facebook</span>
          </a>

          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url={{ encodedUrl }}"
             target="_blank"
             rel="noopener noreferrer"
             class="share-button linkedin"
             aria-label="Share on LinkedIn">
            <span class="icon">💼</span>
            <span>LinkedIn</span>
          </a>

          <a href="https://reddit.com/submit?url={{ encodedUrl }}&title={{ encodedTitle }}"
             target="_blank"
             rel="noopener noreferrer"
             class="share-button reddit"
             aria-label="Share on Reddit">
            <span class="icon">🤖</span>
            <span>Reddit</span>
          </a>

          <a href="mailto:?subject={{ encodedTitle }}&body={{ encodedUrl }}"
             class="share-button email"
             aria-label="Share via Email">
            <span class="icon">✉️</span>
            <span>Email</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>



      {# Disqus Comments #}
      <div class="comments-section">
        <h3>Comments</h3>
        <div id="disqus_thread"></div>
        <noscript>Please enable JavaScript to view the <a href="https://disqus.com/?ref_noscript">comments powered by Disqus.</a></noscript>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="widget">
      <h4>Search</h4>
      <form action="/search/" method="get">
        <input type="text" name="q" placeholder="Search posts..." required>
        <button type="submit">🔍 Search</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="widget">
      <h4>Follow Us</h4>
      <ul class="social-links">
        <li><a href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" target="_blank">Facebook</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ site.social.twitter }}" target="_blank">Twitter</a></li>
        <li><a href="{{ site.social.linkedin }}" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="widget">
      <h4>Subscribe</h4>
      <p>Get new posts in your inbox</p>
      <form action="#">
        <input type="email" placeholder="Your email">
        <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>
